es\\n- State management: React useState hook\\n"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01BsTXDaG1j1CTenmUnUuuCh', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'git log --oneline -20 | head -20'}}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01PyzkGYuzrh7uDPJvd11K9W', 'name': 'run_command', 'input': {'command': 'find . -name "*.json" -path "*/project_state/*" 2>/dev/null | head -5'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01BsTXDaG1j1CTenmUnUuuCh', 'content': '{"success": true, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "9218c72 Successfully implement Smart Task Decomposition Engine with comprehensive functionality\\n6922c97 Implement Maximum Adaptability Protocol to address implementation uncertainty\\n90604ed Document implementation escalation strategy for undefined project\\n474760c Add implementation readiness protocol documentation\\n236156d Activate autonomous resolution protocol for implementation\\n533acf4 Add comprehensive diagnostic report for ongoing exploratory phase\\ne71959e Add comprehensive test strategy for error handling infrastructure with 21-day testing timeline\\n1f74ab7 Initialize implementation investigation with systematic documentation\\n9ac1edd Add comprehensive backend task breakdown for error handling infrastructure implementation\\n4f8417f Initiate investigation into agent permission constraints for tool block synchronization implementation\\nc64587b Clean up output directory - remove duplicate and deprecated files from src/field/ensemble_ui/output/\\ne5baeb7 Add comprehensive documentation for Backend Coordinator error handling mechanisms\\n8589904 Add comprehensive error handling test strategy document\\n29c4f16 docs: Add Unit Test Lead iteration review documentation\\nd7edb32 Document error handling test strategy\\n2f61c48 Add error handling guidelines for Unit Test Lead to address BadRequestError and CircuitBreakerOpenError\\n2492743 Add comprehensive error handling for System Architect a